@startuml
' UML 复习手册 · 共用小例子：随笔 App（mark-readnotes）
' 行为类第 1 张：用例图（Use Case Diagram）
!pragma layout smetana
title 用例图：记随笔的人能用这个 App 做什么

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "用户（记随笔的人）" as User
actor "远端 WebDAV 服务" as Dav

rectangle "随笔 App（mark-readnotes）" {
  usecase "选笔记目录" as UC1
  usecase "新建随笔" as UC2
  usecase "打开并编辑随笔" as UC3
  usecase "预览渲染效果" as UC4
  usecase "按标题/标签/正文搜索" as UC5
  usecase "改标签（整块搬家）" as UC6
  usecase "删除随笔" as UC7
  usecase "管理标签（改名/合并/删）" as UC8
  usecase "刷新索引" as UC9
  usecase "整理旧布局" as UC10
  usecase "按标签导出" as UC11
  usecase "排除某些标签" as UC12
  usecase "系统分享给别人" as UC13
  usecase "同步到自己的网盘" as UC14
  usecase "处理同步冲突" as UC15
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3
User --> UC5
User --> UC7
User --> UC8
User --> UC9
User --> UC10
User --> UC11
User --> UC14
UC3 --> UC4 : <<包含>>
UC3 --> UC6 : <<扩展>>
UC11 --> UC12 : <<扩展>>
UC11 --> UC13 : <<扩展>>
UC14 --> UC15 : <<扩展>>
UC14 --> Dav : 上传 / 下载文件

note bottom of UC11
  导出目录层级＝标签顺序（第 1 个标签一级、第 2 个二级），
  文件名＝标题；「导出并预览」只是先看，不写盘。
end note

@enduml
